          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Airport Overlay</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">DO</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Downtown Overlay</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">LO</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Landmark Overlay</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">TO</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Townsite Overlay</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBody" style="white-space:nowrap">RPO</p>

          </td>
          <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000000; border-left: 0px; border-right: 0px; border-top: 1px solid #000000; padding: 3pt 2pt 2pt 2pt; vertical-align: top">
                        <p class="CellBodyC">Resource Protection Overlay</p>

          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
</table>
            <p class="HistoryNote">(Ord. 2021-17, 7/6/2021 (Res. 2021-33); Ord. 2016-07, Amended, 2/16/2016 (Res. 2016-02))</p>

      <h3 class="Cite" id="10.40.20.030"><a name="10.40.20.030">10-40.20.030</a> Map of Zones</h3>
            <p class="P0">The zones identified shown in Table 10-40.20.020.A, Zones, are mapped on the Zoning Map. (Refer to Section <a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1010010.html#10.10.10.020">10-10.10.020</a>, Zoning Map, and links to where they are found are within Chapter <a href="../Flagstaff10/Flagstaff1090000.html#10.90">10-90</a>, Maps.)</p>

